nt region of West Asia. It is bordered by Lebanon to the north, Syria to the northeast, Jordan to the east, and Egypt to the southwest. Israel's western coast lies on the Mediterranean Sea, its southern tip reaches the Red Sea, and to the east is Earth's lowest point near the Dead Sea. Jerusalem is the government seat and proclaimed capital, while Tel Aviv is Israel's largest urban area and economic centre.","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Israel","source":"Wikipedia","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","iso2":"IL"},{"title":"Lebanon","extract":"Lebanon, officially the Lebanese Republic, is a country in the Levant region of West Asia. Situated at the crossroads of the Mediterranean Basin and the Arabian Peninsula, it is bordered by Syria to the north and east, Israel to the south, and the Mediterranean Sea to the west; Cyprus lies a short distance from the coastline. Lebanon has a population of more than five million and an area of 10,452 square kilometres (4,036 sq mi). Beirut is the country's capital and largest city.","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lebanon","source":"Wikipedia","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","iso2":"LB"}],"arc":{"reports":22,"first_seen":"2026-10-12T10:02:15Z","first_title":"The U.S. and Israel Should Close Aviation Sanctions Loopholes on Russia and Iran","first_url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxOUlM1Mk12aDBrUURkazluQld1RWV0cHVxVWxTQ3V6RnRqMzFWeXI3NVBzUzRmSW5nVnlRUkEzcEVRa3Y1R3JCSG5oMWxhRUVrcF9mQ09rRDhEMGZsdmtTZlZMbi1aQm9XWDlhYUd3ZDJzcDhaaFlwdmlJalp0ZUZiMWJTOGRfMXBzMHo5SmxENUkyQkhTd0FMM09IU0cwbmZxT2ZkOWZuYUdyZFM2NDBOT2dNelY4ek0?oc=5","first_publisher":"Middle East Forum","earlier":[{"id":"e_05fa38f90603","title":"Israel Faces 94 Active Sanctions Measures Worldwide, New Data Reveals","date":"2026-10-22T19:26:00Z","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxPLTdtMGYwMVZxdzkyZWduLUpVdXpfSWdhSG40QUtwVFNBNExYVnNtREM2anJyNmZMRXNPbkFvOTRsTjI2Uld5ZEEwbVZzY0ZfSjBpSGxwWWJRYXhJajFRRUEwc0NtNXEwU0RzZjNvMWFyRUtPbVNSekY2QUYyTHZE